1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
DON'T BLINK
FOR 15 SECONDS

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,800
YOUR EYE IS COATED
IN A TEAR FILM

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,600
IT LASTS ABOUT
10 SECONDS

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,400
THEN IT BREAKS UP
AND STARTS TO STING

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:18,000
HOLD IT…

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,600
BLINK!

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,200
YOU BLINK 15-20
TIMES A MINUTE

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,400
THAT'S ~1 HOUR A DAY
EYES SHUT
(YOUR BRAIN HIDES IT)

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,000
ON SCREENS YOU BLINK
3× LESS

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,200
DID YOU MAKE IT?
SEND THIS TO A
SCREEN STARER
